    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR2p0026-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:11:14.966+09:00">凡是人，都具有与生俱来的本性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:11:35.467+09:00">但是人的心却没有既定的情志,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:12:15.959+09:00">人的情志只有待到与外物相接触后</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:12:19.643+09:00">才开始发作，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:12:36.579+09:00">待到内心喜悦后才开始运行，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:13.651+09:00">直到积久成习后</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:19.8+09:00">才开始确定。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:28.597+09:00">喜气、怒气、哀气、悲气，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:37.927+09:00">都是人的天然本性。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:49.081+09:00">这些本性对外显现出来时，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:52.395+09:00">容易被周围环境事物感化。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:13:59.799+09:00">人的本性来自天命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:14:03.528+09:00">天命自天而降。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:14:27.171+09:00">道从人的情志中萌发，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:14:41.717+09:00">情志从人的本性中产生。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:14:48.619+09:00">道开始近于人情，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-3a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:14:53.388+09:00">最终则近于道义。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:15:03.932+09:00">知情的人能够引发它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:15:10.909+09:00">知义的人能够运用它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:16:17.894+09:00">喜好和厌恶，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:16:24.002+09:00">是人的自然本性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:16:27.461+09:00">所好所恶的对象，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:16:37.543+09:00">都是外在的事物。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:17:16.954+09:00">善良</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:17:21.71+09:00">和不善良，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:17:37.23+09:00">也是人的自然本性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:17:58.363+09:00">以什么为善良</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:18:04.584+09:00">和不善良，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-4a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:18:13.809+09:00">则是一种情势。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:18:52.393+09:00">凡是人的性与外物之间，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:19:49.648+09:00">以性为主，外物从性中延伸而来。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:19:54.947+09:00">金、石都能够发出声音，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:20:05.817+09:00">但没有人敲击</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:20:13.707+09:00">就不能发出美妙动听的乐音。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:20:26.398+09:00">每个人都具有好恶、善良不善良的本性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:20:35.742+09:00">但没有人激发导引，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-5a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:20:47.811+09:00">就不会产生符合人伦的情势。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:21:59.25+09:00">凡心都有自己的情志，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:22:07.057+09:00">没有任何举动</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:22:40.745+09:00">则不会外发。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:22:49.284+09:00">心志不动，则人的肢体不可能单独动作，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:23:14.231+09:00">犹如心志不发，嘴不能单独说话。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:23:42.176+09:00">牛生出来就会成长，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:23:45.529+09:00">雁生下来就会伸展，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:23:58.673+09:00">这种本性都是先天生成的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:26:33.514+09:00">人的本性虽同但由于各自用心不同而结果不一样，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:27:27.788+09:00">万事万物，都是一样的道理。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-6a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:26:35.138+09:00">是因为通过学习而产生种种差异，不可能不学习就是这个样子。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:27:38.87+09:00">物刚强则能支撑，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:28:29.637+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:28:38.242+09:00">柔软则能屈伸，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:29:04.651+09:00">这是物的特性使然。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:29:37.725+09:00">四海之内人的本性都是相同的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:31:43.536+09:00">之所以每个人用心不一样，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-7a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-04T23:31:42.674+09:00">都是外界后天的教导造成的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:52:48.786+09:00">凡是人的本性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:53:01.164+09:00">或者触动它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:53:11.213+09:00">或者逆取它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:53:21.756+09:00">或者交接它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:53:30.417+09:00">或者砥砺它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:53:37.07+09:00">或者激发它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:54:00.041+09:00">或者蓄养它，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-8a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:54:11.398+09:00">或者提高它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T00:55:57.803+09:00">凡能触动本性的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:04:26.83+09:00">必定是外物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:15:42.273+09:00">凡能逆取本性的</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:15:46.817+09:00">必定是喜悦，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:16:00.372+09:00">凡能交接的本性，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:16:08.495+09:00">必定是故意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:16:36.939+09:00">凡能砥砺本性的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:17:03.753+09:00">必定是道义，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:17:11.676+09:00">凡能引发本性的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:17:21.264+09:00">必定是情势，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:17:30.412+09:00">凡能蓄养本性的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:17:37.208+09:00">必定是习惯，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:17:46.124+09:00">凡能提高本性的</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-9a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:18:56.376+09:00">必定是道理。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-10a.1" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:19:18.144+09:00">凡是能见到形色的叫做物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-10a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:19:34.698+09:00">能使自己快乐的叫做悦，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-10a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:19:45.086+09:00">事物所处的形势叫做势，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2p0026_tls_001-10a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-05T01:20:09.195+09:00">故意做样子给人看的，叫做故。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
